[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7201.83, "timestamp": "02:00:01", "text": "最终，这一切都归结于一个名叫战争的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7204.87, "timestamp": "02:00:04", "text": "雷霆崖，他们付了钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7207.75, "timestamp": "02:00:07", "text": "大概花了2万美元。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7211.83, "timestamp": "02:00:11", "text": "我的天啊。仅仅一天之内，就有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7213.87, "timestamp": "02:00:13", "text": "进行了四笔交易"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7218.03, "timestamp": "02:00:18", "text": "花5000美元就能获得价值不菲的《战争雷霆》物品"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7220.35, "timestamp": "02:00:20", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "OH. My. god"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7221.03, "timestamp": "02:00:21", "text": "20,000美元。还有来自《战争雷霆》的战争"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7222.55, "timestamp": "02:00:22", "text": "而且，他们本来就没打算这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7223.75, "timestamp": "02:00:23", "text": "他们根本就没打算给。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7226.31, "timestamp": "02:00:26", "text": "这是愚人节玩笑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7229.43, "timestamp": "02:00:29", "text": "好的。但出于某种愚蠢的原因，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7231.589, "timestamp": "02:00:31", "text": "确保整个金融机制"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7233.589, "timestamp": "02:00:33", "text": "它后面是布置好的。就像你可以付费一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7238.95, "timestamp": "02:00:38", "text": "他们说：“不，没人去。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7240.47, "timestamp": "02:00:40", "text": "去做这件事。”然后有人说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7243.51, "timestamp": "02:00:43", "text": "“你知道吗？我打算这么做。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7246.79, "timestamp": "02:00:46", "text": "此人变现了价值 2 万美元的资产。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7249.91, "timestamp": "02:00:49", "text": "用股票支付。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7252.31, "timestamp": "02:00:52", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7254.39, "timestamp": "02:00:54", "text": "然后，就像他们看到的《战争雷霆》一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7255.99, "timestamp": "02:00:55", "text": "款项已记入他们的账户。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7257.589, "timestamp": "02:00:57", "text": "当时的感觉就像，“哦，该死，不，不，不，不，不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7259.189, "timestamp": "02:00:59", "text": "不，不。"}]